Q: Looking for Easier Ways to Manage Data Objects with Value-Based Minimum Distribution Requirements A: <p>I couldn't quite figure out what you expect your code to do. You've only shown one method, which belongs to a class, but the class itself isn't there. I don't know what <strong>cube</strong> or <strong>rare</strong> are, or anything else, so there isn't much to say about how it works.<br />
As for the method's “design”... it's a little &quot;inappropriate&quot;.<br />
